          "teaser": "<div class=\"teaser-3-9 | mg-card mg-card__hc mg-card-book__hc\"  data-history-node-id=\"105696\">\n    <div class=\"mg-card__visual\">\n      <div class=\"mg-card__image\">\n<div class=\"custom-media media-1-column\">\n                        <div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field--item term-taxonomy--\" data-term-id=\"\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/landscape_16_9/public/2026-08/pexels-domipie-27286879-1-1.jpg?h=7acd6694&amp;itok=CYWEu_nC\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\" alt=\"A stark landscape of cracked dry earth beneath a clear blue sky, depicting arid climate and drought.\" />\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"mg-card__content\">\n      <div  class=\"mg-card__label\">\n            <span >\n                  Update\n      </span>\n    </div>\n                        <div class=\"dp-ib mg-card__date field field--name-field-release-date field--type-datetime field--label-hidden field--item term-taxonomy--\" data-term-id=\"\">\n<time datetime=\"2026-11-04T12:00:00Z\">4 November 2026</time>\n</div>\n      <header class=\"mg-card__title\"><a href=\"https://undrr.ddev.site/news/world-heads-overshoot-15degc-adaptation-too-slow\">As world heads for overshoot of 1.5&deg;C, adaptation is too slow</a></header>\n      <p class=\"mg-card__description\">\n  With global warming set to exceed 1.5°C, adaptation finance falls far short of needs, implementation is constrained by institutional barriers, and losses and damages are mounting, according to new report from the United Nations Environment Programme.\n</p>\n      <div class=\"source-organizations mg-card__organization field field--name-field-organization field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field--items\">\n                                                                          <div class=\"field--item term-id--359 term-taxonomy--organization\" data-term-id=\"359\">United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP)</div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
